This fixture exercises phpc's deterministic placeholder
`mysqli_stmt_send_long_data()` state for active statements. System PHP requires
a real initialized MySQLi connection and mysqlnd long-parameter streaming; phpc
only validates active statement handles, in-range parameter indexes, and string
chunks, then records deterministic chunk state that is cleared by statement
reset. It does not implement real blob binding, packet buffering, send timing,
execution integration, host database state, PHP warning/error fidelity, or
native database lowering.
